# Refinement contracts for MemoryRace (v1.scr).
# The committed balance must be a number; the final Done value must equal the
# initial balance plus both deltas (100 + 50 + 30 = 180). These are payload-
# level guards; the AUTHORITATIVE check is the stateful environment.py, which
# no hallucinated payload can fake.

WriteA(String) from WriterA to MemoryStore
  x: float(x) == 150        # 100 (initial) + 50 (WriterA delta)

WriteB(String) from WriterB to MemoryStore
  x: float(x) == 180        # 150 (A committed) + 30 (WriterB delta)

Done(String) from MemoryStore to Coordinator
  x: float(x) == 180        # correct final balance, no lost update
